<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1903</h1><p class="ref-lede">1903 in world history: 27 events, 14 births, 17 deaths, 4 works, 9 states founded and 8 that came to an end. 815 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
